DESCRIPTION:https://www.simpletix.com/e/dan-frigolette-friends-weldon-mills-event-tickets-270105 \nDurham Comedy Friends | Comedy Night at Weldon Mills DistillerySaturday\, May 30\, 2026 | 8PM | $25\nJoin us for a night of standout stand-up comedy at Weldon Mills Distillery as nationally touring comedians seen on HBO’s Boardwalk Empire\, Game Theory with Bomani Jones\, and The Wendy Williams Show\, and he can currently be seen on RJ Decker\, M.I.A. (Peacock) and Outer Banks (Netflix).\nFor this special one-night event\, features comedians—rising stars and seasoned pros alike—for a dynamic\, unpredictable show packed with laughs.\nCraft cocktails\, premium spirits\, and a killer comedy lineup make this a perfect Saturday night in Durham.\nTickets: $25Showtime: 8PMLocation: Weldon Mills Distillery Durham\, 300 E Main St\, Suite 001\, Durham\,
